<title>JAPAN: Nippon Soda rises on strong business prospects.</title>
<headline>Nippon Soda rises on strong business prospects.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Nippon Soda Co Ltd rose to a high for the year as investors were attracted by the firm's strong business prospects, brokers said.</p>
<p>By 0046 GMT, the caustic soda producer, which belongs to the Industrial Bank of Japan group, had gained 14 yen to 937.</p>
<p>It was the 10th most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo bourse at 1.31 million shares.</p>
